      <shape width="817.58" height="32" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="372" type="text" id="bMH">
        <content paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="12" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体">本页判断：程序默认是一条直线；分支决定走哪条路，循环决定一段路走多少遍。</span></p>
        </content>
